he wrong place, so instead I made my own tool worm_hole which you tell where the tuna is once then it remembers it\nI also don't want a tui for git as I cannot chain tui outputs\njq is nice but when your shell can natively read json it's even better, thanks nushell", "timestamp": 1792315157, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "martini.berlini", "author_id": "1300212362", "id": "17891346111616754", "text": "the command for parsing the api output for word \u201ctuna\u201d with the \u201cjq\u201d was as ridiculous as simply adding \u201cgrep\u201d", "timestamp": 1792181320, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "adarasha_gaihre", "author_id": "58560276834", "id": "17878389912562610", "text": "Kitty shall try yazi next", "timestamp": 1792084938, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "diogo_arw", "author_id": "5461588774", "id": "17913988467467408", "text": "my solution: dont live in the terminal and vibe code everything you dont remember", "timestamp": 1791864305, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "andi.h.87", "author_id": "61930201885", "id": "18121072436283563", "text": "i want a kitty", "timestamp": 1791839083, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "o.ima.machado", "author_id": "34438202", "id": "17932985568407075", "text": "I suppose kitty is already running the kitty terminal", "timestamp": 1791634560, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "ns.priyanshu", "author_id": "67135363208", "id": "17966208162077957", "text": "Zoxide the goat", "timestamp": 1791565612, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "driprdry", "author_id": "42966025391", "id": "17988143556113720", "text": "Sounds like the purr-fect way to boost productivity\u2014thanks for sharing these cat\u2011approved tools!", "timestamp": 1791559560, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "stoic.ankush", "author_id": "54510034635", "id": "18071112416770824", "text": "Rust based tools are must efficient ones though.", "timestamp": 1791526467, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "leongoett", "author_id": "13863587160", "id": "18118842536052883", "text": "The list is missing eza and batcat", "timestamp": 1791520208, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "gaetan_qu", "author_id": "4377947210", "id": "17988919302107559", "text": "Juxtopposed ?", "timestamp": 1791395426, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "roquesystem.exe", "author_id": "40805751391", "id": "18354789151221894", "text": "I use Yazi", "timestamp": 1791392602, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "abida.ali7864", "author_id": "50799151188", "id": "17894209077611931", "text": "\ud83d\udc4f", "timestamp": 1791380464, "like_count": 1}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeIm-UyIzbz/", "original_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeIm-UyIzbz/", "webpage_url_basename": "DeIm-UyIzbz", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "playlist": null, "playlist_index": null, "thumbnail": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/834678061_1831219764721115_8484742328269674908_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ig_cache_key=NDAwMTYxOTY3NzYwOTY3MDM4NzEzMTg3MTA0NzM1ODI1OTg%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fbmZyYW1lX2NvdmVyX2ZyYW1lLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=vTb2vfscyHQQ7kNvwGhbOdm&_nc_oc=Adp4m0iYB6umEFKXid81O40tmfdKxh-3l0VIfj3TMSlsbguZz2l1Kzs96blUHHYuJ6o&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=CJzlL0yRMPr0oIVS4owPyQ&_nc_ss=79689&oh=00_AQNFPy35trPIJ6PG9-NsxdtJlFhZjNhFDcQTLQ4RsogArw&oe=6AE61167", "display_id": "DeIm-UyIzbz", "fulltitle": "Video by coding.kitty", "upload_date": "20261006", "release_year": null, "requested_subtitles": null, "_has_drm": null, "epoch": 1793081714, "url": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMRAISza75Kju-XAeIhbDufuf2UI0vzoWGmt0Ov7eEraY1VAc_y3YVDdXtrCKW9tLjjI-iBPv-mnsVd-qpJfR6kGaiTFE_QAFaQIPs.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=1Ql029Nj4F4Q7kNvwGH3sZX&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTMxODcwOT